  "body": "Intercept execve and execveat for bind destinations, inject the physical\nexecutable as a close-on-exec file descriptor, and preserve replace semantics\nwithout falling back to the carrier destination.\n\nCover initial and descendant mapped ELF execution, execveat read-only\npathnames, destination fallback rejection, and unprivileged Docker smoke on\nAMD64 and ARM64. Bump pathshim to 0.1.4.",
