  "body": "Remove rootfs, overlay, copy-up, and whiteout state in favor of repeatable\nreplace-style bind mappings. Let independent invocations share backing\ndirectories with ordinary filesystem concurrency semantics.\n\nPreserve command process-group and signal behavior, add quiet diagnostics and\npassthrough fallback, and cover bind sharing, external writers, language\nruntimes, cwd semantics, and unprivileged containers on AMD64 and ARM64.",
